{%- comment -%}
  Zodiac slideshow (2026-10-05, owner; replaces the earlier zodiac-row and single-banner
  ideas). Twelve slides, one per sign: photograph (with an optional phone photograph),
  heading, optional short text and a button to a product or collection, the words on the
  picture, centred near the bottom.

  Rules the owner set:
  - Shoppers see only the slides that have a photograph; with none, the section is not
    printed at all. In the theme editor every slide shows, a labelled placeholder standing
    in for a missing photograph.
  - The button shows only when it leads somewhere real: a product, or a collection that has
    products. No invented product details or horoscope claims; the text is optional.
  - Changes every 3 seconds with a gentle fade (owner, 2026-10-05; was 6); line indicators and swiping; no
    pause/play button (owner). Pauses on hover and keyboard focus, stops after any manual move, and
    never starts by itself when the visitor prefers reduced motion (assets/zodiac-slides.js).
  - Cropping: the frame's proportions are section settings (phone and computer apart); each
    photograph is placed by its own focal point, set in Shopify's image editor.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign ready_total = 0
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.settings.image != blank or block.settings.image_mobile != blank
      assign ready_total = ready_total | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    Placeholders (every slide, labelled boxes for missing photographs) show in the theme
    editor, and on a draft preview while the temporary setting "Preview without photos" is on
    (2026-10-05, owner). Never on the published shop: the theme must not be the live one
    (theme.role main) and the page must be the editor, a shopifypreview.com link or an
    unpublished theme, so even a setting left on cannot reach shoppers.
  endcomment
  assign is_live_theme = false
  if theme.role == 'main'
    assign is_live_theme = true
  endif
  assign is_draft_view = false
  if request.design_mode or request.host contains 'shopifypreview.com' or theme.role == 'unpublished'
    assign is_draft_view = true
  endif
  assign show_placeholders = false
  if request.design_mode
    assign show_placeholders = true
  elsif section.settings.preview_placeholders and is_draft_view and is_live_theme == false
    assign show_placeholders = true
  endif
  assign preview_mode = false
  if show_placeholders and request.design_mode == false
    assign preview_mode = true
  endif

  assign show_section = false
  if ready_total > 0
    assign show_section = true
  endif
  if show_placeholders and section.blocks.size > 0
    assign show_section = true
  endif

  assign shown_total = ready_total
  if show_placeholders
    assign shown_total = section.blocks.size
  endif
-%}

{%- if show_section -%}
  {{ 'section-zodiac-slides.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  <script src="{{ 'zodiac-slides.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

  {%- style -%}
    #Zodiac-{{ section.id }} {
      --zodiac-ratio-mobile: {{ section.settings.ratio_mobile }};
      --zodiac-ratio-desktop: {{ section.settings.ratio_desktop }};
    }
    .section-{{ section.id }}-margin {
      margin-top: {{ section.settings.margin_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ section.settings.margin_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    }
    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      .section-{{ section.id }}-margin {
        margin-top: {{ section.settings.margin_top }}px;
        margin-bottom: {{ section.settings.margin_bottom }}px;
      }
    }
  {%- endstyle -%}

  <div class="color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} gradient section-{{ section.id }}-margin">
    <div class="page-width">
      {%- if preview_mode -%}
        <p class="zodiac__editor-note">
          Временен преглед без снимки — вижда се само в черновата. Снимките, текстовете и бутоните предстоят;
          примерният бутон не води никъде. Изключете „Preview without photos“ в редактора, когато снимките са качени.
        </p>
      {%- elsif request.design_mode and ready_total < section.blocks.size -%}
        <p class="zodiac__editor-note">
          Посетителите виждат само слайдовете със снимка (готови: {{ ready_total }} от {{ section.blocks.size }}).
          {%- if ready_total == 0 %} Докато няма нито една, секцията не се показва в магазина.{% endif %}
          Маркираните полета се виждат само тук.
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="zodiac__title h2">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}

      <zodiac-slides
        id="Zodiac-{{ section.id }}"
        class="zodiac"
        role="region"
        aria-roledescription="карусел"
        aria-label="{{ section.settings.overlay_title | default: section.settings.heading | default: 'Зодии' | escape }}"
        data-interval="3000"
      >
        {%- comment -%} One title over every picture, at the top (owner, 2026-10-05). {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.overlay_title != blank -%}
          <h2 class="zodiac__overlay-title">{{ section.settings.overlay_title | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="zodiac__viewport{% if section.settings.overlay_title != blank %} zodiac__viewport--titled{% endif %}">
          {%- assign shown_index = 0 -%}
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign has_photo = false
              if block.settings.image != blank or block.settings.image_mobile != blank
                assign has_photo = true
              endif
              if has_photo == false and show_placeholders == false
                continue
              endif
              assign shown_index = shown_index | plus: 1

              assign photo = block.settings.image | default: block.settings.image_mobile
              assign photo_mobile = block.settings.image_mobile | default: block.settings.image

              assign target_url = ''
              if block.settings.product != blank
                assign target_url = block.settings.product.url
              elsif block.settings.collection != blank and block.settings.collection.products_count > 0
                assign target_url = block.settings.collection.url
              endif
              assign button_label = block.settings.button_label | default: 'Разгледайте'
              assign sign_name = block.settings.heading | default: 'Зодия'
            -%}
            <div
              class="zodiac__slide{% if shown_index == 1 %} is-active{% endif %}"
              role="group"
              aria-roledescription="слайд"
              aria-label="{{ shown_index }} от {{ shown_total }}{% if block.settings.heading != blank %}: {{ block.settings.heading | escape }}{% endif %}"
              data-heading="{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}"
              {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
            >
              <div
                class="zodiac__media"
                {%- if has_photo %}
                  style="--fp-m: {{ photo_mobile.presentation.focal_point | default: 'center' }}; --fp-d: {{ photo.presentation.focal_point | default: 'center' }};"
                {%- endif %}
              >
                {%- if has_photo -%}
                  {%- if shown_index == 1 -%}
                    {%- assign img_loading = 'eager' -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- assign img_loading = 'lazy' -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <picture>
                    <source
                      media="(max-width: 749px)"
                      srcset="{{ photo_mobile | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w, {{ photo_mobile | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w"
                      sizes="100vw"
                    >
                    {{
                      photo
                      | image_url: width: 2000
                      | image_tag:
                        loading: img_loading,
                        widths: '750, 1100, 1500, 2000',
                        sizes: '(min-width: 1600px) 1500px, 100vw',
                        class: 'zodiac__image',
                        alt: block.settings.heading
                    }}
                  </picture>
                {%- else -%}
                  <div class="zodiac__placeholder">
                    {%- if preview_mode -%}
                      <span>Място за снимка: {{ sign_name | escape }}<br>(предстои)</span>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <span>Снимка за {{ sign_name | escape }} — качете я в редактора<br>(вижда се само тук)</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>

              <div class="zodiac__content">
                {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
                  <h3 class="zodiac__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h3>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
                  <p class="zodiac__text">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if target_url != '' -%}
                  <a class="zodiac__button button button--primary" href="{{ target_url }}">{{ button_label | escape }}</a>
                {%- elsif preview_mode -%}
                  {%- comment -%} The intended button, shown but not a link: no destination is chosen yet. {%- endcomment -%}
                  <span class="zodiac__button zodiac__button--sample button button--primary" aria-hidden="true">{{ button_label | escape }}</span>
                  <span class="zodiac__sample-note">Примерен бутон — без връзка</span>
                {%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
                  <p class="zodiac__editor-hint">Бутонът се показва, щом изберете продукт или колекция с продукти.</p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- if shown_total > 1 -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Inside the picture, along the bottom (2026-10-05, owner): one short line per slide,
            centred, the active one in the category pink, each a button with a 44px-tall tap
            area. No arrows, no counter, no pause/play button (owner, 2026-10-05).
            Swiping and the left/right arrow keys also move between slides.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- comment -%} Previous/next inside the picture, computers only (owner, 2026-10-05). {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Small pause/play in the picture's top-right corner (restored 2026-10-05, owner). An
            explicit Pause holds through scrolling away and back; only Play restarts.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="zodiac__toggle"
            data-zodiac-toggle
            aria-label="Спри автоматичното превъртане"
            data-label-pause="Спри автоматичното превъртане"
            data-label-play="Пусни автоматичното превъртане"
            hidden
          >
            <span class="zodiac__icon-pause" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="zodiac__icon-play" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="zodiac__arrow zodiac__arrow--prev" data-zodiac-prev aria-label="Предишна зодия" hidden>
            <span class="svg-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">{{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="zodiac__arrow zodiac__arrow--next" data-zodiac-next aria-label="Следваща зодия" hidden>
            <span class="svg-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">{{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
          </button>
          <div class="zodiac__dots" role="group" aria-label="Зодии" hidden>
            {%- assign dot_index = 0 -%}
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign dot_has_photo = false
                if block.settings.image != blank or block.settings.image_mobile != blank
                  assign dot_has_photo = true
                endif
                if dot_has_photo == false and show_placeholders == false
                  continue
                endif
              -%}
              <button
                type="button"
                class="zodiac__dot"
                data-zodiac-go="{{ dot_index }}"
                aria-label="{{ block.settings.heading | default: 'Зодия' | escape }}"
                {% if dot_index == 0 %}
                  aria-current="true"
                {% endif %}
              >
                <span class="zodiac__dot-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
              {%- assign dot_index = dot_index | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
          <p class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite" data-zodiac-status></p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </zodiac-slides>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Zodiac slideshow",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header", "footer"]
  },
  "max_blocks": 12,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Visitors see only the slides with a photograph; with none, the section is hidden. The editor shows all slides, with placeholders."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "preview_placeholders",
      "label": "Preview without photos",
      "info": "Temporary: shows all slides with placeholders on the draft preview link. Never shown on the published shop. Turn off once the photos are in.",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "overlay_title",
      "label": "Title over the pictures",
      "default": "Вашата зодия"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading above the slideshow (optional)"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "ratio_desktop",
      "label": "Frame on computers",
      "options": [
        { "value": "16 / 7", "label": "16:7 (wide)" },
        { "value": "16 / 9", "label": "16:9" },
        { "value": "21 / 9", "label": "21:9 (very wide)" },
        { "value": "3 / 2", "label": "3:2 (tall)" }
      ],
      "default": "16 / 7"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "ratio_mobile",
      "label": "Frame on phones",
      "options": [
        { "value": "4 / 5", "label": "4:5 (portrait)" },
        { "value": "1 / 1", "label": "1:1 (square)" },
        { "value": "3 / 4", "label": "3:4 (tall)" },
        { "value": "2 / 3", "label": "2:3 (taller)" }
      ],
      "default": "4 / 5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Each photograph is placed by its focal point: open the image in the picker and choose Edit > Focal point."
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Colour scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "margin_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Space above",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "margin_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Space below",
      "default": 40
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "sign",
      "name": "Zodiac sign",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Photograph",
          "info": "Wide, 2000 px or more. Nothing written on the picture."
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image_mobile",
          "label": "Phone photograph (optional)",
          "info": "Portrait. Without it, phones use the photograph above."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "Heading"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Short text (optional)"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "Button"
        },
        {
          "type": "product",
          "id": "product",
          "label": "Product",
          "info": "Used first if set."
        },
        {
          "type": "collection",
          "id": "collection",
          "label": "Or a collection",
          "info": "Not linked while it has no products."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "button_label",
          "label": "Button text",
          "info": "Empty: „Разгледайте“. No button without a product or a collection with products."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Zodiac slideshow",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Овен" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Телец" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Близнаци" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Рак" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Лъв" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Дева" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Везни" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Скорпион" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Стрелец" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Козирог" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Водолей" } },
        { "type": "sign", "settings": { "heading": "Риби" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
